<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<devbook self="eclass-reference/">
<chapter>
<title>Eclass reference</title>
<body>

<p>
This section provides a reference for some of the more commonly used eclasses.
Note that most eclasses have an accompanying manual page. These man pages can
be installed by emerging <pkg>app-doc/eclass-manpages</pkg>.
</p>

<note>
This version of the devmanual does not include the eclass documentation.
</note>
</body>
</chapter>
</devbook>
